  "titleEn": "Mathematics Upper Secondary (Brandenburg, Pilot Source Snapshot)",
  "description": "Erster archivierter Brandenburg-Quellsnapshot fuer die gymnasiale Oberstufe Mathematik. Der Snapshot aktiviert die Phasenanker von Einfuehrungsphase und Qualifikationsphase mit den vier Kurshalbjahren sowie den ersten reviewed Analysis-Einstiegskorridor der Einfuehrungsphase, den ersten reviewed Q1-Modellfunktionskorridor, den ersten reviewed Q2-Integralrechnungskorridor, den ersten reviewed Q2-Stochastikkorridor, den ersten reviewed Q2-Daten-und-Verteilungskorridor und den ersten reviewed Q2-Survey-und-Kritik-Korridor.",
  "descriptionEn": "First archived Brandenburg source snapshot for upper-secondary mathematics. The snapshot activates the phase anchors of the introductory and qualification phases together with the four course semesters and the first reviewed introductory analysis corridor as well as the first reviewed Q1 model-functions corridor, the first reviewed Q2 integral-calculus corridor, the first reviewed Q2 stochastics corridor, the first reviewed Q2 data-and-distribution corridor, and the first reviewed Q2 survey-and-critique corridor.",
